{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_10_level_main_10-09_end","groupId":"main_10","stageId":"main_10-09","title":"旧日之影","storyCode":"10-10","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-09_end.txt","sourceHash":"6b377a8580c03c85f40055a215c7b463d333ac3651362ee7e15f7bc5a3a616b1","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g13_lightinduarea_indoor"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能让你露出这么惊讶的表情，我多少有些意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟，我给过你提示了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你该不会是说那颗石子吧？这种不合时宜的念旧笑话让我一点都笑不出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为来的会是谁？曼弗雷德吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我是在想，特雷西斯会留你一命，还让你在伦蒂尼姆四处蹦跶，他是不是也老糊涂了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你们这么长时间没有声音，我还当你们早就死透了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔......是我想当然了。你看，你说得没错，我确实变得......太多愁善感，以至于一时忘记了，我们都不过是雇佣兵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你引爆炸弹的速度变慢了，W。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你这次手没有发抖呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你从整合运动带走的那些雇佣兵呢？难道你真是一个人来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"带他们来，然后让他们跟你一样，被摄政王收买，反过来给我一堆惊喜吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你很为他们着想。难怪，我没有看到更多熟悉的面孔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就不一样了，在伦蒂尼姆，我可是见到了很多老熟人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还是老样子，真的很爱从我手下挖人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我猜一猜，施瓦布果然已经死了吧？是你亲手杀了他吗，赫德雷？那家伙认识你，比认识我还要久，没错吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杀死一个曾经背着你走了一天一夜，躲过了十几个特雷西斯派来的杀手的老朋友，你握剑的手有没有抖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你记错了。护卫罗德岛号的时候，他已经离队了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，关于这些一起打过仗的人，你的记性一向比我好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早就想问了，记住这些死掉的人，会让你更安心一些吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜并不会，赫德雷，你的表情告诉我，你最近做的噩梦比当年加起来还要多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W，我认识你的时间和你认识我的时间一样长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当你试图变换角度挑起我的情绪的时候，你只不过是想掩饰你自己内心的波动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，你又知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"换作以前的你，一定会毫不犹豫地把那几个拖后腿的反抗军抓过来，当作送给我们的活饵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是有人告诉我，W自愿留下殿后——我一定会告诉他，这个笑话一点都不好笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在切尔诺伯格核心城的那段经历让你彻底疯了吗，W？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是塔露拉烧坏了你的大脑，还是你自己出现了一些不该出现的幻觉，在某个人身上看到了死去已久的影子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"疯子不会承认自己疯了的，是吧？你怎么知道，疯了的人是我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特雷西斯的信任没那么廉价。施瓦布的脑袋远远不够格。你还加了多少码？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，你该不会是把她......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别说这样的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔......反应这么大？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们已经做到了所有能做到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W，是你耽搁得太久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没听错吧，你是想为自己的无能找借口？那时候是谁跟我说自己都打算好了的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为，我是在什么时候失去了一只眼睛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你是说，伊内丝她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，她死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......又来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我才不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雇佣兵会为失信付出代价，而我已经付出了我的代价。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g8_jail"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们出来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗本","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我们这一路上运气是不是有点好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗本","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹士兵都被南边的爆炸吸引过去了，在审讯室附近看守的那几个还被深池提前干掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在战场上相信运气的人一般都不会有什么好下场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵，要不是莫名其妙的好运气，你怎么可能活到现在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......她是谁？他们几个也是从审讯室逃出来的？是......是友军？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（瞄准。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（但是......先不要开火。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你每次见我的时候都要举着弩吗，士兵？别以为我不知道，你们刚才可是一路跟着我们，才顺利地走到这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你想听我感谢你？那你得跟我去伦蒂尼姆最深的监狱里走一趟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说实话，我都快有些佩服你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你跟其他那些满身肥油，只配被倒在下水道里冲走的贵族不太一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了保住以前那种生活，他们可以跪倒在任何人脚下。萨卡兹......或者深池，对他们来说并没有差别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你......你就是不肯放弃，你就跟最讨厌的飞虫一样，不管我走到哪里，你都会冒出来碍我的眼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在碍眼这一点上，彼此彼此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_421_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......咳咳咳......蔓、蔓德拉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这位朋友伤得可不轻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你身边那些士兵也没好到哪里去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来我们都需要赶时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真可惜，今天我没工夫与你纠缠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那挺好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻烦让道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，士兵——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我的石头刺穿你之前......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你最好不要死在萨卡兹手上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗本","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......号角，他们真的又走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......正好，我们还得把弹药留给萨卡兹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗本","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不也觉得我们的行动顺利过头了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论深池从审讯室里带走的是谁，我都不觉得萨卡兹会那么容易地放过他们——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——以及我们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g10_lightinduarea_street_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海蒂女士，你们的人都撤出来了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，阿米娅，大家都在这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海蒂女士，让体弱的人走在最前面，我们会处理掉追上来的雇佣兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费斯特先生，你们还能战斗吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老比尔，抓紧点好吗？待会动起手来可能会有些晃。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，前面也有敌人！应该是从另一个入口处过来的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"发现目标！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快，快过来，干掉他们！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，可别跑得比我们还快。走路不看后面的话，也会摔跤的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还漏了几个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是还没打过瘾吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，先干掉那个术师。万一他往我们的伤员身上扔点什么法术，就很难办了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，摩根，达格达，你们回来了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，博士，我们来得不算太晚吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"正好。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我放心了。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......倒是你，博士，你可没跟我说，来接应我们的只有一个人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"一个人够了。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道吗，博士，越是了解罗德岛，我就越觉得罗德岛神秘......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，不管我见到多少神奇的干员，最神秘的人一定是你呀。"}]},{"label":"其实不止一个。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然......你一定会留后手的，是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这一点上，我们是一样的人呢。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，萨卡兹士兵看起来是被引到这边了，但我们这一路上也没看到太多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在里面替我们拖着敌人的那几位朋友......要不是特别厉害的话，一定会很危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实，我有些担心W小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W？你是说那个很多去过切尔诺伯格的干员念念不忘的W吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，是她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......罗德岛上还真是人才济济啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们......暂时是合作伙伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，她说有事要找海蒂女士的时候，她的眼神不太对劲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你感觉到了什么，阿米娅？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"她不是一直那副样子吗？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的情绪......是比一般人特殊一些。但她在有些时候并没有刻意伪装，在那些时刻，她的眼神骗不了人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上一次她露出那种眼神，还是在她嘶吼着问我要停下核心城的密钥的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她......她是不是还有什么别的话没说出来？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"等她回来，你可以问问她。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"她可是W。她一定还会回来。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的......这一次，我也愿意相信她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g13_lightinduarea_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你流了很多血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你身上也破了好几个洞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你该和过去一样，在身上多藏一颗炸弹的。那样的话，你至少有一次与我同归于尽的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......赫德雷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的人头值多少钱？够你在伦蒂尼姆买一座小房子吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，W。摄政王不会记住像你这样的雇佣兵的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......你也是这么对伊内丝说的吗？在她为你们俩的小小梦想掉脑袋之前？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都这种时候了，你还是这么嘴硬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然呢？为你们俩的愚蠢大笑两声外加鼓鼓掌吗？你别指望在我脸上找到一点伤心的痕迹，赫德雷，那太不像我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......愚蠢的人到底是谁？倒在这里的人是你不是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都说过了，我只是......嗯，有一点小小的惊讶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"惊讶到错过三四次炸断我手脚的机会？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这才真的不像你，W。是什么让你乱了阵脚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，本来以为死了的老朋友原地复活，还想着捅我几剑，这还不够吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这句话听着倒没那么假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W，你说的这位老朋友......到底是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是......讨厌你这一点。你和她一样，总以为能看穿我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很可惜，这一次我依然没判断错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你潜入伦蒂尼姆有一段时间了，会让你如此心神恍惚的人和事还没那么多。你究竟在城内看到了什么，W？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是你跟着特雷西斯，不是我。难道你跪在他的假王座面前的次数还不够多，以至于你还没来得及看清楚他耍的把戏？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你确实知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别再跟我玩什么你知道我知道什么的猜谜游戏了。拿出点雇佣兵的样子吧，赫德雷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能让你活着离开这里，W。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我杀死的这么多熟人中，我相信......你会是最能理解我的选择的那一个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......到底是谁变得更优柔寡断了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是要狠狠瞪着你，看清楚是哪个萨卡兹敢把剑捅进我的心脏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再见了，W。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的剑......被挡下了？那是......匕首？从哪里飞过来的匕首？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_421_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......别动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不见，阿斯卡纶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也别动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，要不然呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等，你是来救我的，我没有理解错吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会吧，你总不能是想帮他？难道你不知道特雷西斯对她做了什么——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是最好扔得更用心一些？我这会可是重伤，差一点就躲不开了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那倒是挺可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道你杀不掉我了，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你当过我的头儿，我也当过你的头儿，可是这里有一个人，她当过我们俩的头儿。而且现在，她明显心情不是很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道。我们俩的人头在下一刻都可能落地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以......我无话可说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......W。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你每多说一句话，血就会流得更快一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道啦，多谢关心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起来......如果不想一起死在这里的话，你就得忍受这一次小小的失败了，赫德雷“队长”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
